    <string name="app_welcome_body_no_lock">AgePony stores your keys, recipients, and notes in a vault sealed on this device. No screen lock is set up, so protect it with a password or PIN. To unlock with a fingerprint instead, set up a screen lock in Android settings first, then create the vault.</string>
